# exact casefold, so one entry never covers both. AGENTS.md is "Codex and AGENTS.md-compatible
# agents"; the skill entrypoint Codex actually loads is SKILL_ADAPTER_PLATFORM. Without the
# second entry the daily-log skill adapter advertises /plan as a live trigger on the one surface
# Codex reads skills from, while --check reports every surface clean.
